  <h2>Engineering Support at Scale</h2>
  <p>A sports bra is the most complex item in an activewear collection. Our design R&D team focuses on "zero-distraction" engineering to support your brand's reputation for quality.</p>

  <h3>Encapsulation & Material Tension</h3>
  <p>We use high-modulus Spandex blends to ensure consistent tension over hundreds of washes. By combining internal molding technology with reinforced under-bust bands, we provide the "High-Support" required for CrossFit and running—categories currently booming in the US market.</p>

  <h3>Inventory Management of Hardware</h3>
  <p>Premium bras require premium hardware. We maintain a high-quality <strong>Inventory Management</strong> of heat-resistant adjusters and low-friction zippers. As your <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, we ensure every component is salt-water and sweat resistant, ready for <strong>Global Logistics</strong> to any climate.</p>
</GuideLayout>
